      "category": "Text",
      "text": "1. In order to review and verify the current status of each piece of City-owned property, it is directed that each Department, Commission, Board, and Agency upon whose request real estate has been withheld from sale, submit a report to the Office of the Deputy Mayor, specifying such property and identifying each parcel by tax block and lot. A statement of whether the set-aside continues to be required and justified should be part of the report.",
